'''Elohim, Essaim''' (エロイムエッサイム, ''Eroimu Essaimu'', '''Elohim Essaim''') is a 4-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effect UP (L): Slow duration increases by 30%.

